---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions · Rajvardhan Singh Badgujar"
  description="Terms and conditions governing the use of Rajvardhan Singh Badgujar's portfolio website and consulting services."
  canonicalUrl="/terms"
>
  <div class="pt-24 pb-16 md:pt-32 md:pb-20 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="bg-white border-2 border-black p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-neo">
      <div class="inline-block bg-neo-secondary border-2 border-black px-3 py-1 shadow-neo-sm -rotate-1 mb-4">
        <span class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs">Legal</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-black mb-6">
        Terms & Conditions
      </h1>

      <div class="prose max-w-none text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-800 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
        <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> October 2026</p>

        <h2 class="text-base font-black uppercase border-b-2 border-black pb-1 pt-4 text-black">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing and browsing <strong>rajvardhansingh.in</strong>, you agree to comply with and be bound by these terms. If you disagree with any portion, please refrain from using this website.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-base font-black uppercase border-b-2 border-black pb-1 pt-4 text-black">2. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          Unless otherwise stated, all site content, project case studies, diagrams, text, and source code examples are the intellectual property of Rajvardhan Singh Badgujar. Open-source repositories linked on GitHub are subject to their respective open-source licenses (MIT, Apache, etc.).
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-base font-black uppercase border-b-2 border-black pb-1 pt-4 text-black">3. Analytics & Telemetry Notice</h2>
        <p>
          To maintain uptime, analyze traffic trends, and evaluate portfolio usability, this website runs an automated visitor tracker. Anonymous session tokens, navigation events, scroll depth milestones, and client-side telemetry are processed and transmitted to Supabase Edge infrastructure as detailed in our <a href="/privacy" class="underline font-bold hover:text-neo-accent">Privacy Policy</a>. Continued browsing signifies acknowledgement of this data transmission.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-base font-black uppercase border-b-2 border-black pb-1 pt-4 text-black">4. Disclaimer & Warranty</h2>
        <p>
          All information, tutorials, and architecture case studies on this site are provided "as is" for portfolio demonstration purposes without warranties of any kind. Implementation of cited architectures in production should be independently evaluated for security and performance.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-base font-black uppercase border-b-2 border-black pb-1 pt-4 text-black">5. External Links</h2>
        <p>
          This website contains links to third-party services and client sites (such as GitHub, LinkedIn, Thikana Dhabla Ghosi). Rajvardhan is not responsible for the content, privacy practices, or availability of external third-party platforms.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-base font-black uppercase border-b-2 border-black pb-1 pt-4 text-black">6. Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p>
          You agree not to probe, flood, reverse-engineer, or execute unauthorized automated requests against this website or its associated backend/telemetry endpoints.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200">
        <a href="/" class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-black hover:text-neo-accent">
          ← Back to Portfolio
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
